    <guid isPermaLink="false">6926630f0084e2631dc23211</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Nov 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>十一来深圳转机啦，本期邀请到我在澳洲的好朋友Mona！目前她在深圳一家视效公司当VJ，今天我们请Mona来分享下她的故事吧。录制日期：2025-10-03</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家眼里的全能舞者Mona，ISFP，澳洲毕业回来后从事了她热爱的VJ行业，每天回家的幸福是院里的美咪给的噢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【风格】</span></p><span></span><p><span>线下访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 1 Highlight</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">0:05</a> 悉达多，余华，舞蹈，院子里的猫补足了我的精神世界</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Part 2 盐田的肠粉还有关于舞蹈的一切</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 咱们去吃肠粉吧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 迷上了KPOP</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a> 重拾古典舞</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> 邵俊婷老师的《爱莲说》有一种看透一切的美</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 我们都爱《舞蹈风暴》！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Part 3 VJ是什么</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> VJ 其实跟灯光老师很像</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Part 4 我的精神食粮</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a> 最喜欢的作者是余华</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a>《第七天》里的死无葬身之地</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a>《悉达多》让万物穿过自己</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Part 5 院子里的美咪</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> 我的流浪小猫们</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>BIRDS OF A FEATHER- Billie Eilish</span></p><span></span><p><span>头像：</span></p><span></span><p><span>「小红书」 NUKIIIIIL（104204892）</span></p>]]></description>
