    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期邀请到我的初中好友Jason，从Nano Science转到Master of Management Analytics，目前定居多伦多，我们一起来听他分享一下加拿大的留学生活吧。录制日期：2025-03-09</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jason本科毕业于北京交通大学，研究生去了多伦多大学读商业分析，目前在多伦多的一家互联网大厂做Applied Scientist。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【风格】</span></p><span></span><p><span>线下访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关频道】</span></p><span></span><p><span>「小红书」Kimmy🐠（958752047）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1 留学经历</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">1:22</a> 创始人为我的播客出谋划策👏🏻</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">2:08</a> 滑铁卢大学和北交大的2+2项目 Nano Science</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">2:47</a> 一定要记录一下初中英语考试14分（满分150）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">4:04</a> 多伦多大学Rotman商学院</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2 推荐系统</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">4:28</a> 互联网大厂 Applied scientist</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">5:08</a> 推荐系统主要是召回和排序</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">7:01</a> Correlation 不等于 Causation, AB testing</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">8:07</a> PM很重要</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3 大模型结合推荐系统</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">8:54</a> 对DeepSeek的看法？单独使用大模型效果不好，需要和已有的系统结合 (Combination Rule)</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 企业比较关注回报率 ROI</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 躺平了觉得无聊</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> AI如何盈利？卖接口的模式不赚钱</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cornfield Chase (原野追逐) - Hans Zimmer</span></p><span></span><p><span>头像：</span></p><span></span><p><span>「小红书」 NUKIIIIIL（104204892）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【花絮】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv5fY_MyRLH53RH2S8CE2DZ4bA2o.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpSExVep_Ss2IyyvYnCT7pZheh1g.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>—— 2024-09-07 在华熙LIVE•五棵松的一家MBTI酒吧里，我和朋友们宣布要做播客啦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtWtPW-Kkhd71hZLZo4lXEV7JLqx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>—— 2024-11-22 The highlander</span></p>]]></description>
