  <item>
    <title>19| 十日止语是什么体验？《内观自己的感受》INFJ &amp; INFJ</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d187b20766616acd78d76e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d187b20766616acd78d76e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期邀请我的好朋友，一位非典型白羊座独立设计师，第三次来我的播客啦，我们一起聊聊她内观的心得吧！录制日期：2025-03-04</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>2008年就认识的初中同班好友，伦敦艺术大学（UAL）本科平面设计专业毕业后回北京做设计师，再之后她选择回到英国学习插画，目前是一位居住在北京的独立设计师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【风格】</span></p><span></span><p><span>线下访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1 小画家去做了总裁助理后辞职</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">1:33</a> 总裁助理日记：今晚宜偷猫</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2 武夷山内观中心</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">2:56</a> 十天的内观修行</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">4:22</a> 30人一期 独立单间</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">4:53</a> 内观是为了更好的生活</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">5:25</a> 什么是观呼吸</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">6:14</a> 每天4点起来打坐</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">7:04</a> 没有手机 没有手表</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a> 感受只是感受本身？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3 心得分享</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">15:31</a> 当感受消失时 不去留恋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a> 刚出内观第一天感官变的清晰了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">19:38</a> 也有人中途退出</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a> 不可以打蚊子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 发现自己的潜意识</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 无常</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【小画家的联系方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：NUKIIIIIL（104204892）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：今晚宜偷猫</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果此刻我还活着 - PostRadio后电台</span></p><span></span><p><span>头像：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书 - NUKIIIIIL（104204892）</span></p>]]></description>
