  <item>
    <title>18| 古典与现代的碰撞《自由的舞者》INFP &amp; INFJ</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c05d24606e5c594041926a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c05d24606e5c594041926a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期邀请到我的舞蹈老师如烟，2015年在unsw看了她的演出后决定重新学习舞蹈，后成为挚友。如烟是澳洲现代舞团首位华人舞者，现代舞专业，但更爱学院派民族舞蹈。那么今天我们和如烟聊一下她的舞蹈人生吧。录制日期：2025-02-23</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如烟是坐标悉尼的洛阳姑娘，自由职业舞者，目前在澳大利亚经营自己的舞蹈工作室。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【风格】</span></p><span></span><p><span>线下访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾的频道】</span></p><span></span><p><span>「小红书」如烟（369266915）</span></p><span></span><p><span>「视频号」如烟-Cynthia</span></p><span></span><p><span>「Bilibili」如烟（650122962）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1 从洛阳到悉尼</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">1:30</a> 我们是2015年在UNSW琴艺轩认识的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">2:02</a> 高中时发现自己很喜欢舞蹈</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">2:36</a> 从UNSW心理学专业转到了会计专业</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">3:38</a> 每个假期回洛阳找老师学舞蹈</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">5:02</a> 毕业后从事金融工作</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2 现代舞和古典舞</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> 在悉尼学习现代舞</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">7:35</a> 成为唯一的中国舞者</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">7:48</a> 怎么定义专业舞者？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 身韵古典舞是长在自己身体里的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 现代舞给我自由的感觉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a> 现代舞和芭蕾分不开</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3 成立如烟舞蹈工作室</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 澳洲的现代舞团是怎样的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> 有自己的工作室也在做自媒体</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>在日落前拥抱 - </span><a href="https://music.163.com/artist?id=12611352" data-url="https://music.163.com/artist?id=12611352"><span>尕尔东</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>头像：</span></p><span></span><p><span>「小红书」 NUKIIIIIL（104204892）</span></p>]]></description>
