  <item>
    <title>17| 泰国自由行《在普吉岛看星星》ENFJ &amp; ENTJ</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67aa12ae247d51713cd72391</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67aa12ae247d51713cd72391</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Raina是我在UNSW最好的朋友和队友，我们一起搬过7次家，见证了彼此的成长。本期我们带着家人们来到泰国过春节，跟着我们一起探索曼谷和普吉岛吧！录制日期：2025-2-1</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Raina是 </span><strong><span>ENFJ </span></strong><span>白羊座，本科毕业于澳大利亚的新南威尔士大学，研究生去了悉尼大学读商业分析，目前在深圳的一家外企做出海。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【风格】</span></p><span></span><p><span>线下访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关频道】</span></p><span></span><p><span>「小红书」INFJ-鱼 （958752047）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1 在普吉岛观星</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">1:25</a> ENFJ的J属性达到了96%</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">1:30</a> 春节带着爸爸妈妈们来泰国</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">1:58</a> 在普吉岛酒店躺着观星</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">2:50</a> 火星有点发红，颜色越红说明星体温度越低，蓝色则是温度越高</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2 曼谷自由行</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">6:35</a> 曼谷市中心闹中取静的酒店 曼谷瑞享BDMS健康度假村</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">7:17</a> 4元一碗的传统船面 Ruathong Noodle</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">8:48</a> BTS轻轨很方便</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> Let's Relax 和 Oasis Spa 对比</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a> 泰国本地朋友推荐的 Kub Kao Kub Pla</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> Google 曼谷办公室</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 湄南河日落餐厅 Horsamut</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a> 奈乐庄园早餐 Nail Lert Park</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 亚洲排名第一的咖啡馆 Factory Coffee</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">21:29</a> 曼谷米其林二星年夜饭 R.HAAN</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3 普吉岛自由行</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> 普吉镇的Graph咖啡和廊饭</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> Royal Tennis Club 太美了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">26:58</a> Hern Coffee and Bistro太好吃了！⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> 海边咖啡厅 Amari Phuket</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 卡伦海滩</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1742">29:02</a> 悬崖咖啡 The Commune 人好多</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 神仙半岛看日落超美</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 包船去了蜜月岛</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 被泥猛和水母蛰了</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Winter Wishlist - Youzee Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>头像：</span></p><span></span><p><span>「小红书」 NUKIIIIIL（104204892）</span></p>]]></description>
