    <title>13| 央企数据科学家《热爱五月天的乐队吉他手》ENTJ &amp; INFJ</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677bddc11962f0b751bf7af5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677bddc11962f0b751bf7af5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>恰逢1314期，本期邀请到我悉尼大学最好的朋友，也是我一生一世的好朋友贝老师！她是个央企打工人，还是一位乐队吉他手。让我们来一起听一下她充满个性的人生旅程吧。录制日期：2024-12-29</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>贝贝高中在北京的一所国际学校，随后，她前往迈阿密大学攻读统计学本科学位。在硕士阶段，她选择了悉尼大学继续深造，专业是数据科学。完成学业后，她回到了北京，在一家央企就职。她是五月天的狂热粉，也是乐队吉他手。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【风格】</span></p><span></span><p><span>线下访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">0:09</a> highlight</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1 性格和生活</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">1:32</a> 一生一世的好朋友！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">3:33</a> 我去悉尼大学是因为我妈说学校像哈利波特楼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">4:36</a> 咱仨是从贴吧认识的？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">4:54</a> 后来搬到wentworth point做邻居</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">5:40</a> 我把贝贝推海里了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">6:47</a> 劈柴烧柴，贝贝给大家做牛排吃</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">7:22</a> 报警了，在塔斯马尼亚做笔录</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">9:28</a> 毕业project全系第一 all girls！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> 在学校meeting room学习 不能喝酒哦</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 铜锅涮肉只吃手切 潮汕火锅匙柄和吊龙 海底捞是火锅牛排还要搭配贝老师灵魂酱料！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2 找工作的经历</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 毕业后进了央企</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 边遛弯边投简历，金融街的拒信我都收过</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 投了86家公司 26家面试 11个offer 不要放弃！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3 成长经历</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> 本科在美国打工</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">17:07</a> 饿过肚子 所以卖机票</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 和父母和解</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1369">22:49</a> 留学生自我吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> ENTJ好工作狂啊</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 4 乐队吉他手</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 五月天粉丝！自己写歌</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 我们的乐队叫备选指南！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 人生迷茫时听了《天使》和《倔强》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">28:55</a> 我们想做专辑</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> 打磨自己的作品 思想永恒</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 一起重温下五月天的《倔强》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>倔强 - 五月天</span></p><span></span><p><span>头像：</span></p><span></span><p><span>「小红书」 NUKIIIIIL（104204892）</span></p><span></span><p><span>「小红书」 桑桑暮雪（272965186）</span></p>]]></description>
